# Google Drive sync. Optional: without it the app builds and runs exactly as
# before, and the Drive card on /backup stays a description with nothing to
# click.
#
# This is an OAuth *client id*, which is public by design — it ships in the
# bundle and is visible to anyone. **There is no client secret in the web flow,
# and one must never be added here.**
#
# The desktop build is the exception, and it is not this file: Google's desktop
# client type does issue a secret, the main process reads it from the
# environment as MYTOME_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET, and it never becomes a file in
# this repo. RFC 8252 §8.5 covers why a credential inside an installed
# application is not confidential in the first place.
#
# See docs/google-drive-sync.md for both clients: how to make them, which
# origins to authorize, and where each value goes.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (git-ignored) to use it in dev.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
MYTOME_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
MYTOME_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
